.md 4.2.1","water_l_yesterday":2.4},"level":"warning","message":"练前 1.5–2 小时吃一顿正餐：碳水 50–70g、蛋白 20–30g；离上一餐超过 4 小时，练前 30–60 分钟再加一根香蕉或一片吐司配蜂蜜。\n不空腹练腿；手边备一根香蕉或一盒果汁（快糖）。\n头晕、手抖、出冷汗、心慌：立刻停组坐下，吃 15–20g 快糖，15 分钟没缓解再吃一次，当天不再做高强度。\n练前 2 小时喝 500ml 水，练中每 15–20 分钟小口喝 150–250ml，1 小时内不超过约 1L。\n昨天只喝了 2.4L（吃肌酸期间目标 3–3.5L）。\n最近有过：2026-10-13 练前没吃够。","message_en":"Eat a proper meal 1.5–2 h before: carbs 50–70 g, protein 20–30 g; if your last meal was more than 4 h earlier, add a banana or a slice of toast with honey 30–60 min before.\nDon't train legs on an empty stomach; keep a banana or a juice box (fast sugar) at hand.\nDizzy, shaky, cold sweat, racing heart: stop the set and sit down, take 15–20 g of fast sugar, take more if it hasn't eased in 15 min, and no more high intensity that day.\nDrink 500 ml of water 2 h before; during training sip 150–250 ml every 15–20 min, no more than about 1 L an hour.\nYesterday you drank only 2.4 L (target 3–3.5 L while taking creatine).\nRecently: 2026-10-13 under-fuelled training.","rule_key":"pre_workout_fuel","sticky":false,"subject":"","title":"今天下肢 B、肩部 routine：练腿，练前吃够、备快糖","title_en":"下肢 B, 肩部 routine today: leg day, eat enough before and keep fast sugar at hand"},{"evidence":{"exercises":[{"cues":"膝盖和脚尖同方向。","exercise":"保加利亚分腿蹲","exercise_id":"bss","reason":"膝盖。","status_basis":"exercise_meta"}],"source":"body-management.md 4.3、exercise_meta"},"level":"info","message":"· 保加利亚分腿蹲：膝盖和脚尖同方向。（膝盖。）","message_en":"· 保加利亚分腿蹲: 膝盖和脚尖同方向。 (膝盖。)","rule_key":"exercise_restrictions","sticky":false,"subject":"","title":"今天计划里有 1 个要小心的动作","title_en":"Exercises to take care with in today's plan: 1"},{"evidence":{"final_target":"23:30","last_night":{"bedtime":"00:14","wake":"07:34"},"night":"2026-10-16","plan_stage":"00:40","source":"body-management.md 6.1、6.2；goals/params.py","tonight_target":"00:40","wake_target":"08:30"},"level":"info","message":"23:40 起停屏、调暗灯光\n咖啡 12:00 前\n晚饭、训练 21:40 前结束\n08:30 起床；起床后 30 分钟内晒太阳 10–20 分钟","message_en":"From 23:40: scre